      "typical_award_size": "Recent loans: 2727 Mattison Lane, unincorporated Santa Cruz County (MidPen Housing, 250 units for families and seniors at 30% to 80% AMI) acquisition loan $9,945,000 through the TECH Fund (April 23, 2025); Beverly Gardens, Scotts Valley (CRP Affordable Housing, 25 units) acquisition loan $3,277,500 (May 28, 2025); 4575 Scotts Valley Apartments (CRP, 100 units) financing (May 30, 2025); Habitat for Humanity Monterey Bay $1,000,000 construction loan for 11 Harper Street homes (2020). Housing Trust reports 14 loans totaling $33 million in the Monterey Bay region, many with Monterey Bay Housing Trust partners.",
