      "typical_award_size": "Chapter 24.16 (Affordable Housing Provisions) contains Part 3, Density Bonus Provisions for Residential Units, and Part 4, Fee Waivers for Affordable Units, per the code table of contents; the City's 2026 Prohousing renewal materials also cite reduced childcare impact fees for 100% affordable housing developments and ADU incentives. Specific waiver amounts, eligible fee types and any local density bonus enhancements beyond Government Code 65915 could not be read because codepublishing.com returned 403 and the zoneomics mirror of Chapter 24.16 is a stub.",
