      "next_deadline": "Requested with the planning entitlement. Confirm Part 4 fee waiver terms and the childcare impact fee reduction with the Planning Division; the Prohousing renewal application (Resolution NS-30,681, June 2026 Council presentation) documents them as existing policies.",
      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "unclear",
      "layering_notes": "Treat as a cost reduction layered on top of the AHTF loan and Measure O compliance; the County's enhanced density bonus (Chapter 17.12.065, up to 50% for 21% or more low income units) and County AHIF exemption apply only in the unincorporated area. Santa Cruz also created Flexible Density Units in four commercial zones (auxiliary units allowed up to the full floor area ratio regardless of density) and the My House My Home senior ADU program, both cited in the 2023 Prohousing application. Marked needs_confirmation because the code text was not opened; the zoneomics chapter index listing Parts 3 and 4 and the City Prohousing page were.",
